# Always repackage after edits

After any code change, rebuild both Windows packages before finishing. Do not skip this because tests passed. Do not ask whether to package.

1. Stop leftover `TelegramMT5Copier` / `TelegramMT5Copier_debug` processes if they lock `dist\`.
2. From repo root:

```powershell
.\scripts\build_exe.ps1 -Clean
.\scripts\build_debug.ps1 -Clean
```

Outputs:

- `dist\TelegramMT5Copier\TelegramMT5Copier.exe` (windowed)
- `dist\TelegramMT5Copier_debug\TelegramMT5Copier_debug.exe` (console)
